<title>USA: Versar to increase shrs to 30 mln.</title>
<headline>Versar to increase shrs to 30 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD, Va. 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Versar Inc said Wednesday that its stockholders have approved increasing the number of common shares to 30 million from 10 million.</p>
<p>Stockholders also approved issuing 10 million shares of designated preferred stock, it said.</p>
<p>Versar, an environmental consulting and infrastructure management company, said it plans to use the additional shares to help finance future acquisitions.</p>
</text>
